From: Akaya1001 <265734908+Akaya1001@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Oct 2026 21:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] patch_cirrus_real84.h: lower MAX98706 amp gain 0x01 -> 0x30 (-24 dB)

Local change of this repository, not part of davidjo/snd_hda_macbookpro.
For MacBookPro14,3 (codec subsystem 0x106b3900) the four MAX98706 speaker
amps were programmed with DigitalVolCtrl 0x01 (nearly full gain). There is
no hardware volume control and no crossover, so use the quieter 0x30
setting that upstream already suggests in a comment.

--- a/codecs/cirrus/patch_cirrus_real84.h	2026-10-18 12:39:07.950214268 +0200
+++ b/codecs/cirrus/patch_cirrus_real84.h	2026-10-18 12:39:07.953010388 +0200
@@ -1019,8 +1019,8 @@
                 // use reduced volume - from 0x01 to 0x30 - now passing as argument
                 // change channel mapping - make a standard left/right pair
                 // so 1st 2 channels are tweeters, 2nd 2 channels are woofers
-                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x64, 0x01, 0x00);
-                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x62, 0x01, 0x02);
+                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x64, 0x30, 0x00);
+                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x62, 0x30, 0x02);
                 // use reduced volume - from 0x01 to 0x30 - now passing as argument
                 //cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x64, 0x30, 0x00);
                 //cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x62, 0x30, 0x02);
@@ -1172,8 +1172,8 @@
                 // use reduced volume - from 0x01 to 0x30 - now passing as argument
                 // change channel mapping - make a standard left/right pair
                 // so 1st 2 channels are tweeters, 2nd 2 channels are woofers
-                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x74, 0x01, 0x01);
-                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x72, 0x01, 0x03);
+                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x74, 0x30, 0x01);
+                cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x72, 0x30, 0x03);
                 // use reduced volume - from 0x01 to 0x30 - now passing as argument
                 //cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x74, 0x30, 0x01);
                 //cs_8409_setup_amp_max(codec, 0x72, 0x30, 0x03);
